+
+Implemented `applyPatch(document, patch)` in `src/index.ts` (RFC 6902: add, remove, replace, move, copy,
+test), with tests in `test/patch.test.ts` (run with `npm test`). Written alongside the RFC appendix A
+examples, plus invalid patches, bounds/index rules, non-mutation and `__proto__` safety.
+`resolvePointer`'s token parsing was extracted into `parsePointer` and is reused; its behaviour is
+unchanged. See decision-log dl-002 for the semantics chosen.
